    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί-σημος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of two times,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.Quint.
					1.14
				</span></i>
			 (but in Music, <i>of four times,</i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Elias
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				189.9
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of doubtful quantity,</i> Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.38H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in Rhythm, <i>of two
				time-units,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος, μέγεθος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Rhyth.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				1.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> of a
			garment, <i>with double border,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				406.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1051.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
